{"id":"wb-7-1733","name":"曹娥庙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"曹娥庙","text":"曹娥庙位于中国浙江省绍兴市上虞区百官街道曹娥江西岸、孝女庙村南30米，是纪念东汉时孝女曹娥的祭地，始于东汉元嘉元年（151）所建之曹娥墓，后因墓而建祠，现存建筑主要建于1931-1936年，占地面积约7000平方米，庙内所有的柱、梁、轩、雀替、门窗等都布满精美雕刻，体现近代工艺之繁富精致，有“江南第一庙”之誉。1989年12月列入浙江省文物保护单位，2013年3月列入第七批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%9B%B9%E5%A8%A5%E5%BA%99","revisionId":86856499,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86856499","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/f566069e05231b3669293bf0.jpg","title":"Caoe_Temple_07_2014-08.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Caoe_Temple_07_2014-08.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1c/Caoe_Temple_07_2014-08.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"猫猫的日记本","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​曹娥庙，山门及墓坊，自东北侧看。","width":320,"height":213}}